      "message": "Errorprone complain:\n\n\u003e ```\nField AUDIO_LOCATION_INVALID is a flagged API and should be inside an if (Flags.leaudioMonoLocationErrataApi()) check (or annotate the surrounding method getAudioLocation with @FlaggedApi(Flags.FLAG_LEAUDIO_MONO_LOCATION_ERRATA_API) to transfer requirement to caller) [FlaggedApi]\n            return AUDIO_LOCATION_INVALID;\n                   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n```\n\nI believe that this is not a new API but a new `deprecated` API.\n\nI recommend to simply suppress the warning by anontation the method\n\n```\n@SuppressWarnings(\"FlaggedApi\") // Due to deprecated AUDIO_LOCATION_INVALID\n```\n\nIdeally we should have a todo to remove this in the following next 3 years as system api can be removed.",
